OL,3,GNEWSAFood festivals across UK exploited
OL,4,Ain AI-powered scam, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish food festivals are being used
OL,7,Fto target small food and craft
OL,8,Fbusinesses in a scam made possible by
OL,9,Fartificial intelligence (AI).
OL,11,FA BBC Wales investigation found dozens
OL,12,Fof traders received
OL,13,Fprofessional-looking emails purporting
OL,14,Fto be from festivals with any requests
OL,15,Ffor money only coming after multiple
OL,16,Femails are exchanged.
OL,18,FOne trader whose "heart sank" when she
OL,19,Fdiscovered she had lost money, said
OL,20,Fthat despite spotting scams regularly,
OL,21,Fthe multiple emails she exchanged were
OL,22,F"so realistic" that she fell for one.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
