OL,3,GNEWSAFood festivals across UK exploited
OL,4,Ain AI-powered scam, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbergavenny Food Festival said the
OL,7,Faccessibility of AI meant scammers
OL,8,Fcould reach more people with scams that
OL,9,Flook "far more believable".
